      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "> It never harmed anyone in the first place.\n\nPeople wearing an avatar don't really have to suffer performance issues from their own avatar. Or maybe quest users are blind to it. Have one friend basically decide that they can only be in instance with 4 or 5 people. Lotta polygons and materials on their avatar.\n\nThe last \"quest compatible\" avatar that I helped a friend upload wanted to use 35mb of uncompressed for the 3d model alone. Blend shape optimization got it down enough.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
