  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-11-20T21:40:51.985Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Remove this limit. Remove the \"security check\". Many, including me, have paid for quest avatars that we can't use anymore because of this. It never harmed anyone in the first place. There can be an added setting that lets players choose a limit of how much they want to allow to download. Add that. it's possible. Please don't ruin the game for everyone just to accommodate some. This is unfair and has done more harm in removing it than allowing it.",
